Package: healthdatascience
Title: Health Data Science Toolkit
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Diogo", family = "Ribeiro", email = "dfr@esmad.ipp.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072"))
Description: Reproducible statistical and data-science tools for clinical,
    epidemiological, and real-world health data, including validated survival,
    longitudinal, missing-data sensitivity, causal-inference, latent-variable,
    Bayesian, biomarker, prediction, and population-health workflows.
